  "readmes": [
    {
      "file": "capacity-formal13-native-supply-failure-analysis-v1/README.md",
      "content": "# Formal13：原生战斗供给失败分析\n\n本轮 1792959622496-365f0175 已结束，原始report、raw verifier和capacity均为false。2/10人分别实测300.259/300.261s通过；25人测满300.254s，五窗中W3/W4未通过。25人阶段218条攻击action全为successful，0timeout、0not-launched；失败是逐fighter攻击发起供给，actor05的正伤害率也低于按真实时长计算的门槛。见[终态事实](facts/formal13-actual-terminal-independent-facts-v1.json)与[失败分析](report-analysis/analysis-v1.json)。\n\n50/100人、7200s soak、resume/save/post均未执行。原阈值未放宽，P0/capacity仍false，P2未启动。7项正常清理为true，另有[Root OS实查](facts/formal13-root-independent-cleanup-v1.json)。\n\nRoot基础collect/verify与独立Store collect/verify四项均exit0，只确认归档一致性，保留游戏失败。Store共106条、23083B，诊断complete；[Store分析](store-analysis/analysis-v1.json)只讨论已完成且超过50ms的记录，嵌套阶段不可相加，不能据此确定Store/IO实际holder、目标竞争、碰撞或容量上限，未确立旧5s停顿根因。successful action并非独立逐请求900ms typed+双端正包重放。\n\n事后采集器只修正catalog.scope轮次并加入self/proof白名单，原100冻结输入保持。可核[原采集器](post-collector/collect-public.mjs)、[派生v2](post-collector/collect-public-current50-v2.mjs)、[精确逆变换与syntax](post-collector/collect-public-current50-v2-derivation-v1.json)、[有效v2独审](post-collector/review-v2.json)及[实际采集执行](execution/formal13-base-collection-execution-v1.json)。[v1审查原件](post-collector/review-v1.json)是PowerShell记录构造错误留下的null JSON，作为历史保留，不视为有效审查；有效v2在实际采集前完成。\n\n大raw/monitor/录像/EXE/private不复制。原始报告和185份基础copy见[基础目录](../capacity-formal-native-v2-account-store-wait-ladder-13/README.md)，Store独立数据见[Store目录](../capacity-formal-native-v2-account-store-wait-ladder-13-store-diagnostics/README.md)。新说明、白名单、复制收据和核验不改原catalog/verification。\n"
    },
    {
      "file": "capacity-formal-native-v2-account-store-wait-ladder-13/README.md",
      "content": "# Formal13 基础公开证据\n\nRun 1792959622496-365f0175：2/10人阶段通过，25人测满300.254s但W3/W4战斗供给未达标；25人218条attack action均successful、0timeout，不能据此改为通过。50/100人、7200s soak及resume/save/post未执行；report/raw verifier/capacity/P0均false，P2未启动。\n\nRoot posthoc v2 collect与原verify均exit0，正常清理7项true；原[报告](release-native-v2-account-store-wait-ladder-13/reports/1792959622496-365f0175.report.json)、[catalog](collect-formal-native-v2-account-store-wait-ladder-13-public-artifact-catalog.json)、[copy provenance](public-copy-provenance.json)、[collection verification](collection-verification.json)、[public verification](public-verification.json)、[raw SHA manifest](raw-artifact-manifest.json)保持原字节。原copy计数185、验证前目录189files均为新增本README之前的真实快照。\n\n50578926B/82186行raw仍在外部，只保原SHA绑定。无新的逐包900ms独立重放或服务器根因判定。见[失败分析及执行历史](../capacity-formal13-native-supply-failure-analysis-v1/README.md)和[独立Store companion](../capacity-formal-native-v2-account-store-wait-ladder-13-store-diagnostics/README.md)。\n"
    },
    {
      "file": "capacity-formal-native-v2-account-store-wait-ladder-13-store-diagnostics/README.md",
      "content": "# Formal13 独立 Store 诊断\n\n本数据集与基础3/4/7日志分开，不参与或改写游戏验收。Run 1792959622496-365f0175已结束；Root Store collect/verify均exit0，106条/23083B，SHA 927baeb695360376d15ade2f3fa8a7dd5d873fcc33ca329e456d807268ee56d8，diagnosticComplete=true。\n\n原[Store catalog](store-artifact-catalog.json)、[copy provenance](store-copy-provenance.json)、[public verification](store-public-verification.json)、[status](store-stage-public-status.json)、[公开Store行](store-stage-public.jsonl)不改。complete只指有界已完成记录的投影一致性；未完成、低于阈值或未instrument的等待不可被排除。duration为同stage最大单次值，samples/total为聚合，嵌套值不可相加。\n\n[基础游戏结果](../capacity-formal-native-v2-account-store-wait-ladder-13/README.md)仍是25人供给失败，P0/capacityfalse、P2未启动；未认定Store/IO holder、死锁、碰撞或CPU容量上限。见[Store分析与终态事实](../capacity-formal13-native-supply-failure-analysis-v1/README.md)。\n"
    }
  ],
